{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.instMax\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">instMax</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Max\">Max</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.instMax","kind":"instance","line":986,"name":"BitVec.instMax","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L986-L986"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.instMin\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">instMin</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Min\">Min</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span>)</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.instMin","kind":"instance","line":984,"name":"BitVec.instMin","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L984-L984"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.cpop\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">cpop</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Population count operation, to count the number of bits with value `1` in `x`.\nAlso known as `popcount`, `popcnt`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.cpop","kind":"def","line":978,"name":"BitVec.cpop","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L978-L982"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.cpopNatRec\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">cpopNatRec</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">pos </span><span class=\"fn\">acc</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Count the number of bits with value `1` downward from the `pos`-th bit to the\n`0`-th bit of `x`, storing the result in `acc`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.cpopNatRec","kind":"def","line":970,"name":"BitVec.cpopNatRec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L970-L976"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.ctz\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">ctz</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Count the number of trailing zeros, returning `w` on zero.\n\nSee `BitVec.ctz_eq` for the specification via `Nat.trailingZeros` and\n`BitVec.ctz_eq_reverse_clz` for the characterization used by the bitblaster.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.ctz","kind":"def","line":957,"name":"BitVec.ctz","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L957-L968"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clz_eq_clzFast\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">clz_eq_clzFast</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\">@<a href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clz\">clz</a> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> @<a href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clzFast\">clzFast</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clz_eq_clzFast","kind":"theorem","line":949,"name":"BitVec.clz_eq_clzFast","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L949-L955"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clzFast\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">clzFast</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Runtime implementation of `clz` using the native natural-number logarithm.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clzFast","kind":"def","line":941,"name":"BitVec.clzFast","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L941-L947"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">noncomputable def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clz\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">clz</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Count the number of leading zeros, returning `w` on zero.\n\nKernel reduction uses a bounded search over bit positions; compiled code uses `Nat.log2`.\n\nSee `BitVec.clz_def` for the specification via `toNat` and `BitVec.clz_eq_clzAuxRec` for\nits bit-by-bit characterization.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clz","kind":"def","line":925,"name":"BitVec.clz","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L925-L939"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clz.log2Aux\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">clz</span>.<span class=\"name\">log2Aux</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Binary search for the highest set bit within `[lo, hi)`, with fuel bounding `hi - lo`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clz.log2Aux","kind":"def","line":893,"name":"BitVec.clz.log2Aux","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L893-L900"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clzAuxRec\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">clzAuxRec</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Count the number of leading zeros downward from the `n`-th bit to the `0`-th bit for the bitblaster.\nThis builds a tree of `if-then-else` lookups whose length is linear in the bitwidth,\nand an efficient circuit for bitblasting `clz`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.clzAuxRec","kind":"def","line":884,"name":"BitVec.clzAuxRec","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L884-L891"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.smulOverflow\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">smulOverflow</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`smulOverflow x y` returns `true` if multiplying `x` and `y` results in *signed* overflow,\ntreating `x` and `y` as 2's complement signed bitvectors.\n\n  SMT-Lib name: `bvsmulo`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.smulOverflow","kind":"def","line":875,"name":"BitVec.smulOverflow","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L875-L882"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.umulOverflow\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">umulOverflow</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`umulOverflow x y` returns `true` if multiplying `x` and `y` results in *unsigned* overflow.\n\nSMT-Lib name: `bvumulo`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.umulOverflow","kind":"def","line":869,"name":"BitVec.umulOverflow","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L869-L873"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.reverse\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">reverse</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Reverses the bits in a bitvector.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.reverse","kind":"def","line":864,"name":"BitVec.reverse","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L864-L867"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.sdivOverflow\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">sdivOverflow</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Checks whether the signed division of `x` by `y` results in overflow.\nFor BitVecs `x` and `y` with nonzero width, this only happens if `x = intMin` and `y = allOnes w`.\n\nSMT-LIB name: `bvsdivo`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.sdivOverflow","kind":"def","line":853,"name":"BitVec.sdivOverflow","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L853-L860"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.negOverflow\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">negOverflow</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Checks whether the negation of a bitvector results in overflow.\n\nFor a bitvector `x` with nonzero width, this only happens if `x = intMin`.\n\nSMT-Lib name: `bvnego`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.negOverflow","kind":"def","line":843,"name":"BitVec.negOverflow","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L843-L851"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.ssubOverflow\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">ssubOverflow</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Checks whether the subtraction of `x` and `y` results in *signed* overflow, treating `x` and `y` as\n2's complement signed bitvectors.\n\nSMT-Lib name: `bvssubo`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.ssubOverflow","kind":"def","line":834,"name":"BitVec.ssubOverflow","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L834-L841"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.usubOverflow\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">usubOverflow</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">x </span><span class=\"fn\">y</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#BitVec\">BitVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">w</span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Checks whether subtraction of `x` and `y` results in *unsigned* overflow.\n\nSMT-Lib name: `bvusubo`.","docLink":"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.usubOverflow","kind":"def","line":827,"name":"BitVec.usubOverflow","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/0b77e12952ad39077d80d8bd6b66d601f225c321/src/Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.lean#L827-L832"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Init/Data/BitVec/Basic.html#BitVec.saddOverflow\"><span class=\"name\">BitVec</span>.<span class=\"name\">saddOverflow</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">w</span>